better multimodal deep learning models, including transformer-based fusion


stronger RL methods such as offline RL or meta-RL


real user studies with students and teachers


A/B testing in actual educational settings


integration of a generative AI tutor for natural-language support


deeper bias testing and more explicit consent controls.



